    "mlflow 3 genai agent evaluation. use when writing mlflow.genai.evaluate() code, creating @scorer functions, using built-in scorers (guidelines, correctness, safety, retrievalgroundedness), building eval datasets from traces, setting up trace ingestion and production monitoring, aligning judges with memalign from domain expert feedback, or running optimize_prompts() with gepa for automated prompt improvement.": "Оценка качества GenAI-агентов с помощью MLflow 3 (`mlflow.genai.evaluate()`): написание функций оценки `@scorer`, встроенные судьи (Correctness, Safety, RetrievalGroundedness), сбор датасетов из трейсов и автоматическая оптимизация промптов.",
